{"title":"2006 SMT/Algebra Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48ceccf1315afec62a9fe9fa50efec10d74aa0ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$aabb=n^4-6n^3$\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are nonzero digits, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer. (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are not necessarily distinct.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/439e7724bd66c13a7b158d21176373c5fd86df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$aabb=(1100)a+(11)b=(11)(100a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"318\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cde04ea62e7844a42f86eb541d292fb5fd28d3c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4-6n^3=(n^3)(n-6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is prime, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e8157f07bd655cac2420b656ca7e09e49ff6c26a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-6$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. However, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e5a50f89eb87941facbb1e7b1ae91777fa10f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/8290b51061b3c7e3e6a4c0dc8e06ab185c85653d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4-6n^3&gt;10000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />, so we only need to consider when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093e72c1ebd91ade8c33ce3bcc3ccd3e640cad8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bfab45e8d2ab59bce89351223a8f6561637198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4-6n^3=6655$\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />, a solution, so the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/17182b168f3f1a37714afa8a20604aecb2196800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,n)=\\boxed{(6,5,11)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"161\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Algebra_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Algebra_Problems\" title=\"2006 SMT/Algebra Problems\">2006 SMT/Algebra Problems</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 98/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3120/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11190:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211932 and revision id 47205. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}